Yesterday (2009-07-12) was the first time I ascended. I had lawful human 
female valkyrie. I started this game in March, so I today watched some 
ttyrecs to refresh my memory a little before writing this.

As usual I headed straight to minetown to see if there is interesting 
altar and my pet dog got killed there. The altar in minetown was not 
aligned, but at least I had one place to BUCid equipment. I went little 
down Then I went quickly down in dungeon to find sokoban. In dlvl 8 I 
found not only throne room (nothing from throne), but I also stepped on 
polymorph trap and become Olog-hai. Being T did not last long enough  in 
next level (9 with oracle) I stepped on another polymorph trap and became 
sewer rat. Soon I was back in my normal form and went to sokoban. Did two 
levels, went back and explored several skipped levels more properly. 
Bought hawaian shirt on dlvl 5, returned to sokoban, got amulet of 
reflection.

Then I spent some time burdened in dungeon. Almost every level had 
something special: I had 4 throne rooms (one genocide for electric eels, 
one identify, few times nothing), beehive, cockatrice nest, barracks, 
swamps and a graveyard a few levels below quest portal (I lured four 
wraiths downwards and got to XP level 16 or 17). I did also some 
dangerous stuff: quaff identified potions and read identified scrolls, 
but I was lucky and nothing bad happened (and I genocided disenchanters 
when I ound out one of my scrolls was geno). I used altars to BUC testing 
scrolls (so no "problems" with cursed geno) and potions and then looked 
through list of what I know and what exists to find out if there was 
somthing really dangerous. Quest and medusa were not really interesting 
(I levitated over lava with ring). Before castle I did some sacrifying 
and got Mjollnir and Ogre Smasher. Later at the same altar (I returned 
there quite often) I got Werebane.

In castle I finally become not burdened. I wished for blessed magic 
marker, +3 GDSM and BoH. I wrote recharge scroll to recharge my wand, but 
some time later I spent a wish on 3 recharge scrolls.

In Gehennom I spent quite much time using pick-axe to destroy as many 
walls as I could. Demon princes were not too difficult.

I had some problems in orcus town level (near entrance in maze part) 
where I was surrounded by monsters. I was levitating over Elbereth but 
got confused by umber hulk and moved away from it. Thankfully I was able 
to move back in time. And somewhere again in Gehennom I had problems with 
two Ls (they cursed my things and summoned many other monsters  now in 
ttyrec I see more than thirty  so I wished for blessed genocide scrolls 
and wiped them out).

After doing Vlad I found VS and had a few months break from NetHack.

When I came back to my game, I decided to do some "sightseeing" and 
search for Fort Ludios. I did not find out how difficult Creosus is 
because some black dragon disintegrated him. And I used one of altars in 
dungeon and got Grayswandir. Then it was down to VS again. It was about 
then when I used last regular wish for speed boots (or was it before 
fort? I am not sure now).

Now it was time when I started to rely heavily on people in #nethack IRC 
channel. I went up to dlvl 1. Several times I got mysterious force and 
twice Rodney. It was good that I dug most of the walls. Once I tried to 
kill Rodney by hitting him, but after fer turns I gladly returned to wand 
of death method. When I reached dlvl 1 I asked people on #nethack if I 
had all equipment I needed. Apparently not. I had amulet of reflection as 
my only source of reflection  and two amulets of life saving in BoH. So I 
went back to Medusa level to get shield of reflection (and changed my 
reflection amulet for life saving amulet) and wrested last wish from my 
only WoW for blessed magic marker. I wrote several scrolls (4 gold 
detections, 1 recharging for MM and enchant armors with rest of MM), made 
my equipment better and went to End Game.

Plane of earth  not too difficult. I had to fight a few elementals, but 
they were not too bad.

Plane of air  very problematic. I really had problems with air 
elementals. Thankfully I could heal in steam vortices. And one step 
before portal to next plane I was engulfed several times in those (and 
once in elemental). I killed vortex and before I could make last one step 
to portal I was in another.

Plane of fire  I just levitated over everything. No fight.

Plane of water  used my last blessed geno scroll to wipe out ;. And then 
levitated towards portal. There I switched levitation for conflict and 
went in.

Astral plane  I went to closest altar, death was behind first door but it 
did not get a chance to hit me. I found out that two of four of my 
telport wands were empty, but finally I got to altar and I was lucky. It 
was the correct one.

I would like to thank everyone on #nethack for really big help. 
